cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use kubescrape in your work, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
type: software
title: kubescrape
abstract: >-
  Kubernetes container logs and Prometheus metrics, shipped as OTLP with
  every record attributed to its pod, workload and namespace. A cluster
  metadata service watches the API server once for the whole cluster; a
  per-node agent tails container logs with at-least-once delivery, scrapes
  Prometheus targets, the kubelet and the systemd journal, and exports
  OpenTelemetry (OTLP).
authors:
